        text: "Lamotrigine is contraindicated in patients who have demonstrated hypersensitivity (e.g., rash, angioedema, acute urticaria, extensive pruritus, mucosal ulceration) to the drug or its ingredients [see Boxed Warning , Warnings and Precautions ( 5.1 , 5.3 )]. Hypersensitivity to the drug or its ingredients.",
