        text: "Repaglinide tablets are contraindicated in patients with: Concomitant use of gemfibrozil [see Drug Interactions (7) ] Known hypersensitivity to repaglinide or any inactive ingredients Concomitant use with gemfibrozil (4) Known hypersensitivity to repaglinide or any inactive ingredients (4)",
