      metabolism: "Following the administration of tretinoin capsules 22.5 mg/m 2 orally twice daily, the mean ± SD peak tretinoin concentrations after the first dose was 394 ± 89 and after 1 week of continuous treatment was 138 ± 139 ng/mL, while area under the curve (AUC) after the first dose was 537 ± 191 ng·h/mL and after 1 week of continuous treatment was 249 ± 185 ng·h/mL. Absorption Time to reach peak concentration was between 1 and 2 hours.",
